From: Pixel 2 Linux project
Subject: [PATCH] Keep the rear optical stabilizer open for its active preview

Find the Walleye LC898123F40 V4L2 subdevice on the selected IMX362's
firmware bus. The driver exports this control separately from the CAMSS
image pipeline. Hold the descriptor only while the user has stabilization
enabled, verify the standard control after each change and release it
when disabling stabilization, switching cameras or leaving the preview.

